{"version":1,"content":"<p>華為公司當地時間11月17日在美國紐約布魯克林聯邦法院迎來刑事案件庭審的最後階段。華為辯護律師在結案陳詞中表示，美國檢方將公司的正常商業活動描繪成一系列蓄意犯罪行為，但經過近兩個月的證據展示，檢方仍未能證明相關指控成立。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586896.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.549606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:22:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"98e80c27b6dcfb8bd4f581b166df10a5784d67e2b2e2b4547a2f198509cbd542","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}